Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.05,0:00:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the diagnosis, Doc?\NWell, so far Odian's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,rate is steady his tests\Nwere fine but i'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,all the mental stress he's\Ngone through has left him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,unconscious yeah i could use\Na nap too the doctor means
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.57,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,he's been knocked out\Njoey you should be really
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,thankful you're not in the\Nsame state you got a good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,point there i mean he and\Ni were both standing right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There when his Egyptian God\Nmonster went all kablooey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from the brain damage\Nhe had going into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Zip it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means\Nwe're not gonna find out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,who this guy is until\Nhe's able to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, but there is\None thing we do know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He was determined to protect Marek\Nfor as long as he could. And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon's lying in a hospital bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and Marek could care less\Nif he ever wakes up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That creeps as nasty as they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect Marek to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:01:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Send flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's times when you're down that\Nyou need friends around the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.51,0:02:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I was able to stand up after\Nthe lightning blast, and Odeon wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, I figured it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how I was able to get to\Nmy feet and win the duel. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you helped me. See, you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I had this dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and it reminded me that my friends\Nwere rooting for me all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was like you were all\Non the field with me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And having you there gave me the\Nstrength to get back up and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that dream's almost as\Ntouching as the one where
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you were making vanilla\Npudding with that monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's a big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, isn't it time for Kaiba to pick\Nthe next two duelists in the finals now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we get a\Nmove on, eh, Yugi? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's dueling next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:03:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, about that dream of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The one without the monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in it, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to help you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I would, but something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough strength to stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Little help, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best friends I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always be here for you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you weren't, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, definitely not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Though most of my dreams are very manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, driving cars, fixing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing soldiers, being a\Nsports star, eating donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, guy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so I'll see you later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Typical guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Last thing I want is for Mai to\Nthink I'm thinking about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:03:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That would cause all kinds of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And who has time for...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one grabbing ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai wanted to feel like your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were too immature to let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like Odeon's not the\Nonly forgotten person in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing I'm not used\Nto, I guess. I'm a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I do things my way, and\Nthat's how I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I got where I am by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No one tells my valentine what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I live, and that's how I duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, there's only one person you\Ncan truly depend on in the heat of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And that person is yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to choose the next two duelists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,for the third match of\Nthe Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Merrick's missing in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And still no sign of that eighth duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, before we start, I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,since Merrick entered this thing with a\Nfake name, shouldn't he be disqualified?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wishful thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But this contest is about\Nskills and not names.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It means to get rid of the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be man enough to use your\Ndeck and not some trivial technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, to obtain the Winged Dragon of Ra,\NI must defeat Marek, not disqualify him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will I be able to return\Nto the glory I once knew. Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Roland. Let her rip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists, remember your numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Select her stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it be me against Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, the results are final.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, bingo baby, keep bouncing,\Nand give us something good. This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first duelist participating\Nin the next match-up is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Number four.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, it's duelist\Nnumber four, Mai Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see who Mai is dueling,\Nand then it's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Selector, begin again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you want to see who\Nyou're going to duel against, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Really makes a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win no matter who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you fellas, I'll be\Nseeing you at the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Marge, we'll be\Nthere rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. What? But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you guys to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I was a\Ngood duelist before I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And quite frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,certain blonde-haired knuckleheads in your\Ngroup are beginning to get on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly clear that you\Ndon't consider me a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't consider you one,\Nso let's just leave it at that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,monkey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That is completely untrue, and\NI'm no monkey boy. Relax, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that key, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take care of something\NI should have done ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you poor, pathetic fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my old friend, it's time to\Ntake a trip to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we can't have you waking up and\Ntrying to contain me again, now can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you see my father,\Ngive him a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that I can't thank\Nhim enough for creating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelist number five, Marek Ishtar, will\Nbe facing off against my Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Both duelists must report to\Nthe dueling arena immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how fortunate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you worry, I will be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The announcement was\Nbroadcast in every room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he chickened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, speak of the freak show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't take too long. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't take long for me\Nto seize this loser's prized
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian god card and then use\Nit to win the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be cast into the\Nshadows Elevate the playing field
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My valentine, Merakishkar, ready\Nyour decks. This duel will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to show you what real\Ndueling's all about Good luck Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,now ladies first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Dunamis Dark Witch in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it away, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting things off quickly, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what my deck has for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather us. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll summon my revival\Njam in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And the magic card, Jam Breeding Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster-producing machine will create
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,one slime token for me\Nwith every passing turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd suggest you attack now before\Nmy slime creatures far outnumber you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see that Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.07,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, it started already. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we shouldn't have waited for\NTristan to get out of the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Mai, we're with ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Show this creep who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And just what are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I make it clear that I don't\Nneed your help to win this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know that, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But friends are still\Nallowed to come watch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to show we care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the time my grandma came to see\Nme play a tree in the school pageant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick used these same plasma\Nmonsters against me. And it can only
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,mean one thing I must warn Mai Or\Nshe'll be in a great deal of danger
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My move now Wait, before you\Ngo, you need to know Revival...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, were you listening to what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't need your\Nhelp So I'd appreciate it if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you could all just mind your\Nown business Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it yourself, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are brave words from someone with no\Nidea what they're up against Oh, Clampet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what I'm\Nup against And exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,what I'm gonna do to\Nbeat you as well Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,why do I see such fear in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Our battle has only just begun and already
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you doubt yourself You\Nare wrong again Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my dark witch, attack his Revival\NJam with Spellbinding Blot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it for Revival Jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You better look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Revival Jam is able to regenerate\Nitself whenever it's attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you do need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this, my pot of green,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a magic card that allows me to\Ndraw two more cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, have you realized that this\Nduel is far more than you can handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe as my jam-breeding machine\Ncreates the first of many slime tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, I place this face down on\Nthe field to render your attacks useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick must have thrown down a trap card
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.91,0:12:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that's somehow able to\Nblock Mai's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just what Merrick did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably using his gem breeding machine\Nto create enough monsters to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll summon his Egyptian\Ngod card, the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this, the magic card,\NHarpy's Feather Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It blows away all your\Ntrap and magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Merrick, but I saw your dirty\Nlittle plan, so I swept it right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai sure handled that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's in for much worse if\Nhe summons his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dark witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the coast is clear, so attack that\Nslime token with spellbinding flux.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.07,0:13:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Mai's already got the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, rejoice, you fools. Celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you all to be full of\Nhope so it will be that much
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,more devastating when I thrust\Neach of you into the dark abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, to complete my turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll place one card face\Ndown and that'll do it. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Melkid the Four-Faced Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sacrifice Revival\NJam and Melkid the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Four-Faced Beast to\Nsummon the Masked Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Discordius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That is one powerful monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack my Masked Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy her Dark Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate my trap card, Mirror Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It attacks your beast with its own\Nreflection, cutting its power in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Witch, finish off his masked beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.09,0:14:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-blan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Marix lost even more life points. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not time to celebrate yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my masked beast leaves\Nbehind the Mask of Remnants,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows me to reshuffle my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, I gain\Ncontrol of your dark wits. Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll do away with your pathetic\Nlittle trap as I play the magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove Trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mai's in some\Nserious trouble out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She better come up with something before\NMerrick unleashes that Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's doing just fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, take a look at\Nthe scoreboard, bozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's winning this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Joey's trying to be\Nnice, but Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick pulls out that winged\Ndragon of Raw, I'm a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Merrick, you may have gotten\Na few lucky shots, but that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Much more than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.57,0:15:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's up with that creepy smile\NMerrick's wearing all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My, something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me, foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that practice time is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd like to take this match to the true\Nhome of Duel Monsters, the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon? Oh, no. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Shadow Game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not part of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Heart of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as I feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick has summoned the evil\Npowers of the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the Shadow what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It just looks like we flew into a fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.55,0:16:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So they've experienced the\Ndangers of this realm before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this time there will be no escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, end this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows are hungry,\Nand they will be fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If little Mai wants to continue this\Nmatch, she'll have to do so in my world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,a world where there's much more\Nto lose than just a simple duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.09,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, this duel must end now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more at stake than you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeit the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, have you completely lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked hard for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:17:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a lot more than some\Ncreepy fog to scare me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you'll excuse me, I've got a\Nduel to win. My! Listen, Yugi, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone, I appreciate your concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but my mind's made up and I'm\Ngoing to stay in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing can change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that I could\Ncount on you to use that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,stubborn mind of yours while\Nyou still remember how.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.61,0:17:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing about mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,once the girl makes up her mind,\Nthere's no way to unmake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it might cost her. Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always ready for a shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope mine knows what she's up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rules of the game as she\Nknows them are about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down, and\NI summon the unfriendly Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:17:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she glowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Confused, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy that surrounds your\NAmazon is a symbol of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,or your mind to be more precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If it goes out, so will\Na portion of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the nature of the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll understand it much better once\Nyou've experienced my dark magic first hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I love watching someone feel\Nthese shadow powers for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There is something very wrong with\Nthis guy, but I can't get distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my unfriendly Amazons, attack\Nthe Dark Witch with Soaring Clash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've wiped away some of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Dark Witch was\Noriginally your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you've wiped away\Npart of your memory as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,each monster we play on\Nthe field carries with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:19:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it the memory of a person\Nwe hold within our mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So when a monster is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the memory of a person from\Nyour life is destroyed with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is Marek talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That psycho's gotta be out of his gourd!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see which one of your friends\Nwill become your first lost memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and now she'll be\Nbanished from your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that. It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I\Nbrought you here, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,For I'm controlling this\Nkingdom of infinite blackness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.07,0:19:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the time I'm through,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be a mindless shell all\Nalone in a world full of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel them drifting slowly away\Nfrom you, disappearing into the light,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,fading from the chasms of your\Nmind, the wells of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, come back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, don't worry, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only losing one of them\Nfor now. I can't see her that's
